    "note": "WHERE on the hand a carried object sits, WHICH hand at which heading, HOW it is angled, and WHETHER it draws over or under the sprite. Offsets are BODY-LOCAL METRES, not cell px, so one table is correct at any elev, any density and any deck-rock roll/pitch.",
